[{"client_msg_id":"8def1f2d-9654-44b1-869e-e7f56fc003c4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ブラウザに定義されてる API やらなんやらのすべてが返却されるんですよね。（Console クラスとか）","ts":"1633668964.255400","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1633668977.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b6ND"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B63A0D3D-EE63-4C2D-B1DC-1BA7D651472C","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"TSだとnode_modules全探索してるからすごいとかですかね","ts":"1633668774.254000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"falxD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f6a940c-e3bf-4d63-a7a4-a4e41942127c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"1万件帰ってきた場合、調べてみたら Lua ネイティブの sort 関数がボトルネックだったので、打つ手なしで悲しい","ts":"1633668525.253300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"poh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faced3c1-fc10-4a10-8f26-9dcf93e65a55","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"候補が一万件…。","ts":"1633668465.252000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F4osp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c17ecc3d-a393-4c1c-b1f2-d684eb50a60a","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"coc/cmp は LSP 仕様にほぼ完全に対応してるのが強みです","ts":"1633668454.251700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Izt2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00daa718-053e-4aef-9372-bde08ef29d8a","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"補完プラグインは補完に注力するべきで補完の周辺は別に任せるのがよいと思っている","ts":"1633668443.251200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jWdD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f46a7ac8-3352-4589-bc82-0d238d63827b","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"流石に候補が1万件も帰ってくると ddc や coc, coq のように別プロセスでハンドリングできないと厳しい。\n対策は考えてるけど現状では\n\n1. coc を使う\n2. cmp を使う（TS の場合は少しラグが発生するかも）\n3. ddc を使う（現状は自動インポートできない）\nな感じになりそうです","ts":"1633668410.249600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FOvTO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2fd75567-6457-41ab-8210-083854e27dda","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc-nvim-lspで実装する必要性は感じない","ts":"1633668371.248500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AKR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1b5e6fb-d676-4e27-a045-9b110e09eef1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddc-nvim-lsp-docのように。","ts":"1633668351.247100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vp6F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59682ac5-5c2b-4e22-a28d-7657ff6ae455","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ただ、TypeScript の場合は、nvim-cmp は少し遅くなる可能性もありますし、一長一短かもですね。","ts":"1633668285.245200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ajcq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58235d49-3155-4590-b772-b63b57002f3d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これ誰かが対応させればよいと思うんですよ…","ts":"1633668251.244100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rpP8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d41c3a0-45dd-4603-a3cf-aad10354b1a1","type":"message","user":"U01DL33QJTX","text":"\u003c@U8R597E9H\u003e \nそう簡単にはいかないのですね、、、\n個人的によく使う機能なのでnvim-compe使わせていただきます:pray:","ts":"1633668149.243500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U8pwT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47c9a5c6-b4f9-4415-ab43-0a369212f90e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"TypeScript の自動インポートは completionItem/resolve しないといけないので、単純に vim-vsnip-integ を入れれば自動インポート可能。とはならないと思います。（nvim-lsp の場合）","ts":"1633665105.241400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01G63H9VN3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pD+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4ca04f4-51a0-4f03-95a9-4d8fdfd5a88a","type":"message","user":"U01DL33QJTX","text":"なるほど\nddc使う前はnvim-compeでauto importしていたのでnvim-lsp自体は対応していました\nmatsui54さんの言うとおり複数のプラグイン使うことで対応できるか試してみます！","ts":"1633662956.239400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U01G63H9VN3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xmev"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3E07EF67-FE35-4D98-9919-74A282AEC0C7","type":"message","user":"U01G63H9VN3","text":"たぶんtextEditの機能なので、vsnipとvsnip-integを入れればできると思います","ts":"1633656138.236100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/O4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ba6e8a1-f8d0-45f4-a6b8-f14f0e2f29e0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"auto import、個人的には必須なんだけど人によっていらないって言ってて面白い","ts":"1633653658.235700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"65o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b64dd66a-e7a0-4169-9507-0127b302ee73","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"auto import、何で提供されてるんだろう\nCodeActionかな","ts":"1633652533.235200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kd93"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2716369f-00e1-49c8-bf52-eee6aaef1b8d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"LSPサーバとクライアントがその機能を提供していれば、CompleteDoneのタイミングで発火するはずです\nnvim-lspはどうだったかな……","ts":"1633652253.234600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"61KM6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b62fd894-ed76-4cc5-9d62-4916a7135403","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003c@U8R597E9H\u003eさんが詳しいと思います","ts":"1633648627.232300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rBYl+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"822beff2-cd34-48b5-acd7-30aa825612b3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1U